ated Notice:"]," These Terms of Service were generated with the assistance of artificial intelligence (AI) and may contain errors or omissions. They are not a substitute for professional legal advice."]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"Acceptance of Terms"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"By installing and using the KJB Reader browser extension (\"KJB Reader - SidePanel\"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please uninstall the extension."]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"Description of Service"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"The KJB Reader browser extension is a free, non-commercial companion tool that detects King James Bible verse references on web pages and displays them in a browser side panel. It provides Bible search, reading, and verse lookup functionality. The extension is available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, and Opera."]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"Free and Public Domain"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"The King James Bible text used in this extension is in the public domain worldwide. In the United Kingdom, the KJB is protected by a perpetual Crown Copyright administered by the King's Printer. This extension is intended for personal, non-commercial use only."]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"Use of the Extension"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"You agree to use the extension only for lawful purposes. You agree not to:"],["UL",{"class":"space-y-2 list-disc pl-5"},["LI",{},"Use the extension in any way that breaches applicable local, national, or international law."],["LI",{},"Attempt to gain unauthorised access to, interfere with, or disrupt the extension's systems or data."],["LI",{},"Reproduce, duplicate, or resell the extension for commercial purposes without permission."]]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"No Accounts Required"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"The extension does not require an account. There is no sign-in, no cloud sync, and no remote data storage. All your preferences exist only on your device. You are responsible for managing your own data."]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.03]"},["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3"},"Permissions"],["DIV",{"class":"font-sans text-sm text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed space-y-3"},["P",{},"The extension uses these permissions: activeTab (detects Bible verse references on web pages), contextMenus (right-click verse lookup), sidePanel (displays the reader in the browser side panel), storage (stores preferences locally), and tabs (opens website links in new tabs). No page content is collected or transmitted."]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-card/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/60 roun